#. Small hint inside the TikTok / Instagram / Facebook / YouTube built-in browser. In a browser font, mixed case. Keep Chrome and Safari in Latin letters.
#: tools/web_shell.html
msgctxt "web.in_app"
msgid "Plays best in Chrome or Safari: tap the menu (... or the share icon) and choose Open in browser."
msgstr ""

